cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ltpred, please cite the software and the methods it implements."
title: "ltpred: LT-FH++ (and PA-FGRS) genetic-liability estimation in Python"
abstract: >-
  A Python implementation of the liability-threshold model conditioned on family
  history and age of onset (LT-FH++ / ADuLT), with both a truncated-multivariate-
  normal Gibbs sampler and the deterministic Pearson-Aitken (PA-FGRS) estimator.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Vilhjálmsson"
    given-names: "Bjarni Jóhann"
repository-code: "https://github.com/bvilhjal/ltpred"
license: GPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - liability-threshold model
  - LT-FH++
  - ADuLT
  - PA-FGRS
  - genetic liability
  - family history
  - GWAS
